 "_spec": "covenant@2:297ca24fdcef",
 "content": [
  {
   "text": "{\"recommendation\":\"escalate\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue to Plan (Section 6.3) fails for the three months ended October 31, 2026. Revenue was {{fact:32b5f800-7ba4-40ae-a06e-98552fb2dd87}} of the Approved Plan, below the required minimum of {{fact:97c5f746-53de-4edc-8b8d-533a44d4b33e}}. The borrower's October certificate reports the same figure, {{fact:76cd453d-92fa-4e7f-9576-e17ea7ae2ed6}}, and states it was not in compliance. Approved terms version 1 is the only version on file, and no amendments are waiting for approval. Searches of the documents found no waiver and no written update to the Approved Plan. I reran the test under version 1 and it still fails: {{fact:29c31cd6-7373-4876-b3d4-086110c21498}} against {{fact:ede80d2b-61a0-469a-9d54-d7722a8f477c}}, a shortfall of {{fact:0c782896-89e4-4b19-91b2-46d4a52a8fb5}} relative to the requirement. The September certificate also reported non-compliance with this covenant, so the shortfall goes back more than one period. Nothing found explains the failure, so it appears to be a real breach.\",\"claims\":[{\"text\":\"The agreement requires revenue for any three-month period to be at least the stated percentage of the Approved Plan.\",\"document_id\":\"35b96211-258d-456d-9c15-c10caa937655\",\"page\":4,\"quote\":\"Revenue for any three-month period shall not be less than 80% of the\\nApproved Plan for the same three months.\"},{\"text\":\"The Approved Plan can be changed only by written agreement between the lender and the borrower.\",\"document_id\":\"35b96211-258d-456d-9c15-c10caa937655\",\"page\":3,\"quote\":\"\\\"Approved Plan\\\" means the monthly revenue plan approved by the Lender and recorded in the Lender's credit file, as updated by written agreement of the Lender and the Borrower.\"},{\"text\":\"The borrower's October 2026 certificate says it was not in compliance with Revenue to Plan.\",\"document_id\":\"dad4141b-5089-4390-b07e-11702708fae2\",\"page\":1,\"quote\":\"As of October 31, 2026, the Borrower was not in compliance with: Revenue to Plan.\"},{\"text\":\"The borrower's September 2026 certificate also reported non-compliance with Revenue to Plan.\",\"document_id\":\"f47ca1c0-51fc-4ed4-8199-09de12191be2\",\"page\":2,\"quote\":\"Not less than 80.00% of plan\\nIn compliance\\nNo\"}],\"calc_ids\":[\"76c82a74-9c9b-4a6d-8eef-668deba57b38\",\"d8ffbbe3-00c4-4712-8e80-bf067c8e18e8\"],\"missing_evidence\":[],\"suggested_tag\":\"true_breach\"}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
